        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1999 San Marino Grand Prix\n- People: Michael Schumacher\n- Organizations: Formula One, Benetton, Ferrari, Mercedes\n- Roles: German racing driver\n\nFacts:\n- The 1999 San Marino Grand Prix was a Formula One motor race held on 2 May 1999.\n- The 1999 San Marino Grand Prix was a 62-lap race.\n- Michael Schumacher won the 1999 San Marino Grand Prix by two laps.\n- Michael Schumacher was a German racing driver who competed in Formula One.\n- Michael Schumacher raced in Formula One for Benetton and Ferrari.\n- Michael Schumacher spent the majority of his Formula One career with Ferrari.\n- Michael Schumacher later returned briefly to Formula One and raced for Mercedes.",
