        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Schumacher\n- Events: 1999 San Marino Grand Prix\n- Companies: Ferrari, Benetton, Mercedes\n- Topics: Formula One\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Schumacher was born on 3 January 1969.\n- Michael Schumacher is a retired German racing driver in Formula One.\n- Michael Schumacher raced in Formula One for Benetton and Ferrari, and he spent the majority of his career with Ferrari.\n- Michael Schumacher later returned briefly to Formula One and raced for Mercedes.\n- At the 1999 San Marino Grand Prix, Michael Schumacher drove for Ferrari.\n- Michael Schumacher started the 62-lap 1999 San Marino Grand Prix from third position and won the race.",
